
 Welcome to the Gentoo installer and rescue disc.

   Install Gentoo ............  gentoo-installer  (starts with the desktop)
   Install in text mode ......  sudo gentoo-installer-text
   Repair a Gentoo system that does not start
                                sudo gentoo-rescue  (finds, mounts and repairs)
   Network ...................  nmtui             (text menu) or nmcli
   Hardware report ...........  sudo lshw -short ; sudo dmidecode -t system
   Disk health ...............  sudo smartctl -a /dev/sda
                                sudo nvme smart-log /dev/nvme0

 You are the user "gentoo" (no password, sudo works). Nothing on your disks
 is changed until you start an installation or a repair. This disc is for
 64-bit x86 PCs; Secure Boot has to be off (see SECURE-BOOT-OFF.txt).
 Browser for the handbook: links https://wiki.gentoo.org/wiki/Handbook

